OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after getting hit
OL,4,Aby bus on A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being hit
OL,7,Fby a bus on the A14 eastbound near
OL,8,FCambridge.
OL,10,FNational Highways confirmed the road
OL,11,Fwas shut between junction 31, the
OL,12,FGirton Interchange for the M11 and the
OL,13,FA1307, and junction 33 at Milton,
OL,14,Ffollowing a crash at about 13:40 BST.
OL,16,FCambridgeshire Police are leading the
OL,17,Fresponse and have confirmed a
OL,18,Fpedestrian was declared dead at the
OL,19,Fscene. Their next of kin has been
OL,20,Finformed.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
