OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after getting hit
OL,4,Aby bus on A14
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic caught within the closure has
OL,7,Fbeen released, but the section is
OL,8,Fexpected to remain shut for several
OL,9,Fhours "due to the severity of the
OL,10,Fincident", National Highways added.
